# A bare return at the level that opens a sub closes it (the grammar, section 17). The sub written with no body is a callable, the return is the last
# statement of its body; the sub written with a body gets the return at the end of that body (the receiver form sub [name args code]).
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: with_body 0
)
sub: bump_empty ()
return
sub: bump_body ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\with_body := 5
return
bump_empty()
bump_body()
